<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">RETURNS / KEEP THE ORIGINAL STORY</view><view class="row"><view class="title">退货与核对</view><button class="primary compact" bindtap="create">＋ 退货</button></view><view class="subtitle">关联原销售，核对商品、退款和佣金冲回。</view><view class="notice">管理员办理。退款须先在线下实际完成，再登记退款参考号。</view><view class="muted small">已加载 {{items.length}} / {{total}} 条</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="ghost compact gap" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card gap" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail" hover-class="pressed"><view class="row"><text class="record-title">退货 #{{item.id}}</text><text class="badge {{item.state}}">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="record-sub">原销售 #{{item.sale_id}} · {{item.reason}}</view><view class="row"><text class="money"><text class="currency">{{item.currency}}</text>{{item.state === 'DRAFT' ? '待核价' : item.money}}</text><text class="link">查看与处理 →</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在同步退货记录…</view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !items.length}}" class="empty">暂无退货记录。</view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="ghost gap" bindtap="more" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多</button>
</view>
